":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":10135,"digest":"sha256:dc4d92df104b4f80d9bd06ba1a1a1df85348bd1392360db6b0eb17dcf4df5f92","download_count":3,"created_at":"2026-11-01T18:15:42Z","updated_at":"2026-11-01T18:15:42Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/asamarts/alint/releases/download/v0.21.0/SHA256SUMS.cosign.bundle"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asamarts/alint/releases/assets/699121225","id":699121225,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSGVK6M4pq75J","name":"THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.html","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"text/html; charset=utf-8","state":"uploaded","size":392921,"digest":"sha256:09ab74a4c16c44f34ba6ed835a49352ad507e7598e9e2c965e46c981b2df8aea","download_count":1,"created_at":"2026-11-01T18:15:42Z","updated_at":"2026-11-01T18:15:42Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/asamarts/alint/releases/download/v0.21.0/THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.html"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asamarts/alint/tarball/v0.21.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/asamarts/alint/zipball/v0.21.0","body":"## What's Changed\n* docs(bench): v0.20.1 bench-scale results by @github-actions[bot] in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/354\n* docs(roadmap): file build-script rerun and test-binary merge by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/355\n* fix(editors): override the VS Code extension's vulnerable dev deps by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/358\n* docs(release): require the Trusted Publisher step in the same release by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/357\n* fix(build): watch the checkout's real git files in build.rs by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/356\n* docs(adr): accept the v0.21 relation IR design (ADR-0023) by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/359\n* build(tests): build each crate's integration tests as one binary by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/360\n* fix: address the increment audit of #359 and #360 by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/361\n* feat(xtask): replay the v0.12 corpus at its pinned commits by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/362\n* perf(ci): gate relation-layer changes against the v0.18.2 reference by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/363\n* fix: address the second audit of this increment (#361-#363) by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/364\n* feat(core): add the internal relation types (v0.21 R1) by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/365\n* docs(adr): accept ADR-0024 and supersede ADR-0023 by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/366\n* feat(core): relation row adapters and read/decode caches (v0.21 R2) by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/367\n* feat(rules): add key_parity on the relation layer (v0.21 R3 core) by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/368\n* feat(rules): complete key_parity's format matrix (v0.21 R9) by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/369\n* perf(bench): record the v0.21 relation read-coalescing scenario (R3) by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/370\n* feat(rules): add the v0.21 shadow IR harness for cross_file equals (R4) by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/371\n* ci(corpus): run the shadow IR in corpus replay (R5 integration) by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/379\n* feat(core): add the v0.21 plugin contract traits and bridge (R6a foundation) by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/380\n* feat(core): bridge the contract analyzer and harden contract limits (R6a) by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/381\n* fix(core): keep plugin_api super imports inside the contract by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/382\n* fix(core): bound contract adapter and analyzer output (R6a) by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/383\n* feat(cli): inject the rule registry through runtime command paths (R6a) by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/384\n* feat(lsp): inject the rule registry through config and sessions (R6a) by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/385\n* test(rules): add the key-parity contract analyzer pilot (R6a) by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/386\n* test(rules): compare the key-parity contract pilot with the real rule (R6b) by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/387\n* feat(rules): run key_parity comparison through the contract analyzer (R6b) by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/388\n* docs(wit): add the alint:plugin@0.1.0 contract draft (R7) by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/389\n* fix(wit): regenerate the plug-in wire lock in v2 format by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/390\n* fix(corpus): do not crash when a baseline is refused for analysis failures by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/391\n* docs(v0.21): record the successful shadow corpus replay by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/392\n* docs(v0.21): record the R8 readiness matrix and conditional go by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/393\n* docs(v0.21): record measured R8 budgets and the RSS no-go by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/394\n* docs(v0.21): bisect the S2 RSS regression to v0.19 by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/395\n* docs(v0.21): record the symbolized RSS profile by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/396\n* fix(bench): terminate generated Rust sources and revise the workload by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/397\n* fix(bench): generate clean text and hoist the relation-cache lookup by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/399\n* perf(rules): prefilter import_gate's Rust preset by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/400\n* test: pin the import-gate prefilter and clean benchmark sources by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/401\n* docs(v0.21): record the final-candidate corpus replay by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/402\n* fix(rules): complete the cross_file shadow scope (R4 hardening) by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/403\n* docs(v0.21): record the expanded-scope shadow replay by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/404\n* docs(v0.21): remove stale pre-fix R8 evidence by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/405\n* docs(v0.21): record the pre-release audit and hold the release by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/406\n* fix(rules): make key_parity compare keys by identity and read literal peers by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/407\n* chore(deps)(deps): bump the patch-and-minor group across 1 directory with 2 updates by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/398\n* chore(deps)(deps): bump gradle-wrapper from 9.8.1 to 9.8.2 in /editors/jetbrains in the jetbrains-patch-and-minor group by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/378\n* chore(actions)(deps): bump Swatinem/rust-cache from f0d9c3887740aee45f6153b24b3a6b815192ec16 to c8037a86dde8214a8310e9f54a8fc61ab362aa31 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/376\n* chore(deps)(deps): bump vscode-languageclient from 10.1.2 to 11.0.0 in /editors/vscode by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/377\n* chore(deps)(deps): bump jsonschema from 0.58.6 to 0.60.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/373\n* chore(actions)(deps): bump the actions-patch-and-minor group with 4 updates by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/375\n* fix: v0.21 increment review (key_parity, Dependabot follow-ups, plan docs) by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/410\n* fix: close the v0.21 readiness gaps (W2) by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/411\n* test(contract): consume the witforge 0.1 candidate by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/409\n* fix(contract): close the gaps found reviewing the witforge consumer by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/412\n* docs(contract): record witforge going public (adoption step 3) by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/413\n* fix(contract): close the gaps found in the second consumer review by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/414\n* fix(contract): close the gaps found reviewing the published witforge by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/415\n* ci: pin dtolnay/rust-toolchain to its master branch by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/416\n* ci(contract): check the plugin contract against witforge in default CI (W2-7) by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/417\n* docs(release): prepare v0.21.0 (W3) by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/418\n* build(release): pin the release toolchain to Rust 1.99.1 by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/419\n* chore(release): bump workspace to 0.21.0 by @asamarts in https://github.com/asamarts/alint/pull/420\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/asamarts/alint/compare/v0.20.1...v0.21.0","mentions_count":2}